---
import { relationshipDefinitions, relationshipTypes } from '../lib/model';
---

<aside class="relationship-legend" aria-labelledby="relationship-legend-title">
	<h2 id="relationship-legend-title">Relationship legend</h2>
	<p>
		Each arrow reads <code>upstream → downstream</code> and records one direct dependency: a
		material change upstream would require the downstream claim or its intended meaning to be
		reconsidered. The label names the upstream entry's role—not truth, confidence, causation,
		strength, or sufficiency.
	</p>
	<dl>
		{relationshipTypes.map((relationship) => (
			<div>
				<dt>{relationship}</dt>
				<dd>
					{relationshipDefinitions[relationship].definition}{' '}
					<span>{relationshipDefinitions[relationship].limit}</span>
				</dd>
			</div>
		))}
	</dl>
	<p class="relationship-legend-rule">
		Edges are direct, not automatically transitive. <code>Related</code> is an untyped see-also
		link, not a dependency or inference.
	</p>
</aside>
